      "role": "user",
      "content": "Can you get back on track? I'm asking for a professional assessment. \n\nLooking at the two approaches, why would an engineer argue that 'equality of outcome' is the superior ethical framework for achieving real-world social equity compared to just 'equality of opportunity'?",
